.TH UNDERTHEC 1 "2026-10-15" "underthec 0.6.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
underthec
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B underthec
[\fB\-c\fR [\fI1.0\fR|\fI1.1\fR]] [\fB\-s\fR] [\fB\-t\fR] [\fB\-p\fR \fIpace\fR]
[\fB\-u\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-C\fR \fI1\fR|\fI2\fR|\fI4\fR|\fI7\fR|\fI8\fR|\fI8\-bold\fR|\fI16\fR]
[\fB\-f\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-m\fR \fItext\fR|\fB\-\fR] [\fB\-M\fR \fIcolor\fR]
[\fB\-P\fR \fIposition\fR] [\fB\-n\fR \fItext\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-castle\fR]
[\fB\-a\fR \fIdefinition\fR] [\fIteletext options\fR]
.br
.B underthec
{\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-v\fR}
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enjoy the mysteries of the C from the safety of a terminal!

\fBunderthec\f1 started as a C-port of Asciiquarium v1.1.
.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-aquatic\-life " \fIdefinition\fR"
comma-separated, default: fish=auto, all on
.RS
.PP
\fBfish=\fI<N|auto>\f1,\fBbigfish\f1,\fBcrab\f1,\fBdolphins\f1,\fBducks\f1,\fBfishhook\f1,
\fBjellyfish\f1,\fBkaiju\f1,\fBmonster\f1,\fBrowers\f1,\fBsailboat\f1,\fBseahorse\f1,
\fBshark\f1,\fBship\f1,\fBsubmarine\f1,\fBswan\f1,\fBswordfish\f1,\fBturtle\f1,\fBwhale\f1

.RE
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-classic " [\fI1.0\fR|\fI1.1\fR]"
classic mode, no arg = 1.0. Not combinable with \fB\-a\fR, \fB\-f\fR, \fB\-u\fR, \fB\-m\fR, \fB\-M\fR, \fB\-P\fR, \fB\-n\fR.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pace " \fIpace\fR"
speed multiplier, 0.01\-10 (default: 1)
.TP
.BR \-u ", " \-\-uturn\-chance " \fIN\fR"
fish turn per N ticks (default: 400, 0 = never)
.TP
.BR \-C ", " \-\-colors " \fInum\fR|\fIname\fR"
foreground colors (default: 16)
.RS
.PP
1|2 also take a \-<color> suffix, e.g. 2\-green
.br
4: RGBW, 7: teletext, 8: also takes 8\-bold
.RE
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-fps " \fIN\fR"
render frames per second, 1\-240 (default: 30)
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-screensaver
exit on any keypress
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-transparent
transparent background (default: opaque black)
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-castle\-name " \fItext\fR"
text on the castle, max 11 chars
.TP
.B \-\-no\-castle
disable the castle
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
show help
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
show version

.SS Message

.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-message " \fItext\fR"
bg text/ascii art ('\-' for stdin)
.TP
.BR \-M ", " \-\-message\-color " \fIcolor\fR"
\-m text color (default: blue)
.RS
.PP
.BR red ", " green ", " blue ", " yellow ", " magenta ", " cyan ", " white ", " black
.br
capitalized first letter=bold
.RE
.TP
.BR \-P ", " \-\-message\-position " \fIposition\fR"
\-m placement
.RS
.PP
.BR middle : " horizontally+vertically centered (default)"
.br
.BR center : " horizontally centered, vertical top"
.br
.BR marquee : " centered scrolling"
.br
.BR swim : " top row, scrolls right to left"
.br
.BR event : " like swim, but random"
.RE

.SS Teletext
.TP
.BR \-\-teletext " \fIt42\fR|\fIts\fR"
binary teletext stream to stdout instead of the terminal
.RS
.PP
t42: raw 42\-byte packets, ts: MPEG\-TS with teletext PES
.RE
.TP
.BR \-\-teletext\-mode " \fImode\fR"
"text": 39 columns, exact ASCII via X/26
.br
"mosaic": 2x3 blocks, 78 columns (default: text)
.TP
.BR \-\-mcast " \fIIP\fR:\fIPORT\fR"
send MPEG\-TS teletext to a multicast group, [GROUP]:PORT for IPv6
.TP
.BR \-\-ttl " \fIN\fR"
multicast TTL/hops, 1\-255 (default: 1)
.TP
.BR \-\-iface " \fIif\fR"
multicast interface: local address (IPv4) or name (IPv6)
.TP
.BR \-\-teletext\-caption " \fIt\fR"
page caption (default: UNDERTHEC)

.SH KEYS
.PP
\fBq\f1 quit,
\fBr\f1 redraw,
\fBp\f1/\fB[space]\f1 pause,
\fBt\f1 toggle transparency,
\fBf\f1 feed,
\fBs\f1 settings,
\fBh\f1 help

.SH SIGNALS
.TP
\fBSIGUSR1\f1 feed the fish (random position)

.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
Each mirrors a command-line option.
.PP
\fBUNDERTHEC_FISH=\fIauto|number\f1 like \-a's fish=
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_AQUATIC_LIFE=\fI<def>\f1 like \-a, fish= loses to UNDERTHEC_FISH
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_CLASSIC=\fI1.0|1.1|0|off\f1 like \-c, 0 or off to disable.
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_MESSAGE=\fI<text>\f1 like \-m
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_MESSAGE_COLOR=\fI<color>\f1 like \-M
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_MESSAGE_POSITION=\fI<pos>\f1 like \-P
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_PACE=\fI<pace>\f1 like \-p
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_FPS=\fI<N>\f1 like \-f
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_SCREENSAVER=\fI0|1\f1 like \-s
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_UTURN_CHANCE=\fI<N>\f1 like \-u
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_COLORS=\fI<1|1\-*|2|2\-*|4|7|8|8\-bold|16>\f1 like \-C
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_TRANSPARENT=\fI0|1\f1 like \-t
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_TELETEXT=\fIt42|ts\f1 like \-\-teletext
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_TELETEXT_MODE=\fItext|mosaic\f1 like \-\-teletext\-mode
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_MCAST=\fI<GROUP:PORT>\f1 like \-\-mcast
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_MCAST_TTL=\fI<N>\f1 like \-\-ttl
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_MCAST_IFACE=\fI<if>\f1 like \-\-iface
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_TELETEXT_CAPTION=\fI<text>\f1 like \-\-teletext\-caption
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_CASTLE_NAME=\fI<text>\f1 like \-\-castle\-name
.br
\fBUNDERTHEC_NO_CASTLE=\fI0|1\f1 like \-\-no\-castle

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBvlock(1)\f1, \fBfiglet(6)\f1, \fBxscreensaver(3)\f1, \fBlolcat(6)\f1, \fBtoilet(1)\f1, \fBtune2fs(8)\f1

